":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1019905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[71,73,67,44,62,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1019905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10045","city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,73,67,44,62,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1019905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"刘璋部下武将，刘璋欲利用刘备除张鲁，请其入蜀时遭到部下刘璝与张任的强烈反对。迎刘备的宴会上，挡下了奉庞统之命欲舞剑恐吓刘备的魏延的攻击。刘备杀高沛、杨怀二人，夺取涪水关后奉命与张任等人防守雒县，败军之际遭部下张翼所杀，投降刘备。","tc":"劉璋部下武將，劉璋欲利用劉備除張魯，請其入蜀時遭到部下劉璝與張任的強烈反對。迎劉備的宴會上，擋下了奉龐統之命欲舞劍恐嚇劉備的魏延的攻擊。劉備殺高沛、楊懷二人，奪取涪水關后奉命與張任等人防守雒縣，敗軍之際遭部下張翼所殺，投降劉備。","en":"An officer under Liu Zhang. When Liu Zhang sought to use Liu Bei to eliminate Zhang Lu by inviting him into Shu, this move was fiercely opposed by his subordinates Liu Gui and Zhang Ren. At the welcoming banquet for Liu Bei, he blocked Wei Yan's attack when Wei Yan attempted a sword dance to intimidate Liu Zhang on Pang Tong's orders. After Liu Bei killed Gao Pei and Yang Huai and seized Fu River Pass, he was ordered to defend Luo County alongside Zhang Ren and others. During the defeat, he was killed by his subordinate Zhang Yi, who then surrendered to Liu Bei.","jp":"劉璋配下の武将。劉璋が劉備を利用して張魯を討とうと入蜀を要請した際、配下の劉璝や張任らから強い反対を受けた。劉備を迎える宴会では、龐統の命を受けて剣を舞い劉備を威嚇しようとした魏延の攻撃を阻んだ。劉備が高沛と楊懐の二人を斬り、涪水関を奪取すると、命を受けて張任らとともに雒県を守備したが、敗軍の際に部下の張翼に討たれ、張翼は劉備に降伏した。","kr":"유장의 부하 무장. 유장이 유비를 이용해 장로를 제거하고자 촉으로 불러들이려 했을 때, 부하 유괴와 장임이 극렬히 반대했다. 유비를 맞이하는 연회에서 방통의 명을 받고 검을 휘두르며 유비를 위협하려던 위연의 공격을 막아냈다. 유비가 고패와 양회 두 사람을 죽이고 부수관을 빼앗자, 명을 받아 장임 등과 함께 낙현을 지켰으나 패전하던 와중에 부하 장익에게 살해당했고, 장익은 유비에게 항복했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10268","remark":"","surname":"刘","surnameTc":"劉","surnameEn":"Liu","surnameJp":"劉","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"璝","nameTc":"璝","nameEn":"Gui","nameJp":"璝","nameKr":"괴","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"刘璝","power":"WJ10045","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"189","city":"CS1039","gender":"0","rule":"71","force":"73","wise":"67","politics":"44","charm":"62","will":"75","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"29/29/75/29/29/21/50/29","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1019905","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5000","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"4400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1008401","professions":"3/0/0/3/2/0/2/0/0/0/2/3/1/2/3/1/1/2/1/2/1/1/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"36","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","evaluate":"2000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"165","show":"189","death":"214","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1004602","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1019905","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;12/1;26/1;31/1;57/1;30/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"刘璋部下武将，刘璋欲利用刘备除张鲁，请其入蜀时遭到部下刘璝与张任的强烈反对。迎刘备的宴会上，挡下了奉庞统之命欲舞剑恐吓刘备的魏延的攻击。刘备杀高沛、杨怀二人，夺取涪水关后奉命与张任等人防守雒县，败军之际遭部下张翼所杀，投降刘